WEBVTT

00:01:30.395 --> 00:01:32.289
(Music ends)

00:01:32.313 --> 00:01:34.487
I see some of you recognize this child.

00:01:35.146 --> 00:01:38.536
Now, if he practices for a year
and takes lessons, he's now eight

00:01:38.560 --> 00:01:39.742
and he sounds like this.

00:01:39.766 --> 00:01:41.091
(Music)

00:01:45.894 --> 00:01:47.085
(Music ends)

00:01:47.109 --> 00:01:49.976
He practices for another year
and takes lessons -- he's nine.

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:51.628
(Music)

00:01:55.163 --> 00:01:56.641
(Music ends)

00:01:56.665 --> 00:01:59.949
Then he practices for another year
and takes lessons -- now he's 10.

00:01:59.973 --> 00:02:02.194
(Music)